  {
   "name": "requirement_links",
   "description": "Connect planning requirements to Go/Rust/TS code. requirement creates a record; add links record+selector (exact/qualified name, path:line[:column], or unchanged symbol: ref); remove/refresh require link ID. list filters record/symbol/file; check reports non-ok links with differences and suggestions (moved is unconfirmed unless allowMoved); requirements_for selects symbol OR file with optional definite-caller impact; unlinked finds records and optionally public symbols; history reads receipts. Suggestions are NEVER applied. No application source is written. Queries sync the graph unless noSync. Waits up to 5s by default, returning the first bounded page or a progress handle; wait:false opts out. Finish graph indexing before link work on a cold project.",
